{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Mila stands in line at school and waits her turn for the slide.","words":[[0,0.37],[0.44,0.86],[0.92,1.01],[1.09,1.41],[1.45,1.56],[1.63,2.07],[2.16,2.35],[2.44,2.77],[2.83,2.97],[3.05,3.35],[3.42,3.58],[3.63,3.7],[3.76,4.74]]},{"text":"She says Please when asking to borrow crayons.","words":[[0,0.21],[0.27,0.52],[0.66,1.02],[1.07,1.25],[1.32,1.67],[1.73,1.8],[1.87,2.18],[2.25,3.25]]},{"text":"After snack time, she says Thank you to the helper.","words":[[0,0.37],[0.43,0.78],[0.86,1.25],[1.28,1.42],[1.49,1.86],[2.07,2.39],[2.44,2.53],[2.61,2.68],[2.74,2.81],[2.89,3.76]]},{"text":"In the library, she uses a soft voice because it is a quiet place.","words":[[0,0.17],[0.22,0.29],[0.36,1.08],[1.13,1.29],[1.37,1.71],[1.76,1.81],[1.9,2.28],[2.36,2.76],[2.82,3.2],[3.25,3.34],[3.41,3.53],[3.6,3.65],[3.75,4.25],[4.34,5.2]]},{"text":"At a friend's home, shoes are left by the door. Mila follows the house rule.","words":[[0,0.19],[0.23,0.28],[0.35,0.76],[0.81,1.21],[1.35,1.66],[1.71,1.87],[1.93,2.17],[2.24,2.38],[2.45,2.52],[2.58,3.06],[3.45,3.74],[3.83,4.26],[4.31,4.38],[4.45,4.76],[4.82,5.53]]},{"text":"Before hugging a classmate, Mila asks, May I give you a hug?","words":[[0,0.45],[0.51,0.89],[0.97,1],[1.07,1.78],[1.82,2.11],[2.19,2.8],[3.18,3.37],[3.44,3.46],[3.55,3.75],[3.77,3.89],[3.96,4],[4.08,4.78]]},{"text":"When she coughs, she covers her mouth and washes her hands.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.31,0.43],[0.52,0.95],[1,1.14],[1.22,1.58],[1.64,1.73],[1.8,2.1],[2.16,2.28],[2.36,2.74],[2.81,2.93],[3,3.9]]},{"text":"After art class, she helps clean brushes and put papers away.","words":[[0,0.37],[0.44,0.69],[0.74,1.17],[1.22,1.37],[1.45,1.75],[1.82,2.14],[2.21,2.66],[2.72,2.81],[2.88,3.08],[3.15,3.63],[3.69,4.41]]},{"text":"Her teacher explains that manners can look different, but kindness is the goal.","words":[[0,0.22],[0.29,0.69],[0.76,1.3],[1.32,1.49],[1.57,1.99],[2.06,2.23],[2.3,2.52],[2.6,3.25],[3.46,3.67],[3.76,4.38],[4.43,4.54],[4.6,4.67],[4.74,5.53]]},{"text":"Mila ends the day proud: small respectful actions make a big difference.","words":[[0,0.4],[0.48,0.71],[0.77,0.84],[0.91,1.11],[1.21,1.74],[2.13,2.62],[2.72,3.38],[3.46,3.92],[3.99,4.23],[4.25,4.3],[4.39,4.63],[4.71,5.76]]}]}